              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikonyït nyu pïchoni ECHOTYON akïsagh körkeyïntin cho kipötöy, akïtökïmi monekwa kïsoghöy lenyoni nko ye.",
          "type": "text",
